{"id":"cea19c66617da13a","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-stalk-universal-property.md","title":"Theorem II.5 Universal Property of a Stalk","display":"Theorem II.5 Universal Property of a Stalk","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-stalk-universal-property","aliases":["14-thm-stalk-universal-property"],"display":"Theorem II.5 Universal Property of a Stalk","depends_on":["[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]"],"source_location":"II.5, printed 84, equation (2); DjVu 48","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-stalk-universal-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-stalk-universal-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.5 Universal Property of a Stalk"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.5, printed 84, equation (2); DjVu 48"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,x,D_x(P),P_x,\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}\">\\(P,x,D_x(P),P_x,\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in U\\in\\tau\">\\(x\\in U\\in\\tau\\)</span> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_U:P(U)\\to A\">\\(c_U:P(U)\\to A\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow c_V\\rho^U_{P,V}=c_U\">\\(x\\in V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow c_V\\rho^U_{P,V}=c_U\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{germ}\">\\(\\mathrm{germ}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c:=\\iota h\\in A^{P_x}\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\left(x\\in U\\Rightarrow\\forall s\\in P(U)\\ h(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}(s))=c_U(s)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c:=\\iota h\\in A^{P_x}\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\left(x\\in U\\Rightarrow\\forall s\\in P(U)\\ h(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}(s))=c_U(s)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!h\\in A^{P_x}\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\left(x\\in U\\Rightarrow\\forall s\\in P(U)\\ h(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}(s))=c_U(s)\\right),\\qquad c([(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=c_U(s)\\quad((U,s)\\in D_x(P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!h\\in A^{P_x}\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\left(x\\in U\\Rightarrow\\forall s\\in P(U)\\ h(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}(s))=c_U(s)\\right),\\qquad c([(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=c_U(s)\\quad((U,s)\\in D_x(P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若两代表在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 上相等，锥相容性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_U(s)=c_W(s|_W)=c_V(t)\">\\(c_U(s)=c_W(s|_W)=c_V(t)\\)</span>，所以公式与代表无关。每个茎都有代表，故该公式既保证存在又保证唯一。它是邻域反向包含范畴上限制函子的余极限性质；不用选择代表的全局选择函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $P,x,D_x(P),P_x,\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}$ 如 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]。$A\\in\\mathcal U$，对每个 $x\\in U\\in\\tau$ 给定 $c_U:P(U)\\to A$，满足 $x\\in V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow c_V\\rho^U_{P,V}=c_U$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{germ}$ 沿用 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"P,x,D_x(P),P_x,\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in U\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"c_U:P(U)\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V\\subseteq U\\Rightarrow c_V\\rho^U_{P,V}=c_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{germ}","display":false},{"tex":"c:=\\iota h\\in A^{P_x}\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\left(x\\in U\\Rightarrow\\forall s\\in P(U)\\ h(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}(s))=c_U(s)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists!h\\in A^{P_x}\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\left(x\\in U\\Rightarrow\\forall s\\in P(U)\\ h(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}(s))=c_U(s)\\right),\\qquad c([(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=c_U(s)\\quad((U,s)\\in D_x(P)).","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"c_U(s)=c_W(s|_W)=c_V(t)","display":false}],"bytes":1603,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalk-universal-property|Theorem II.5 Universal Property of a Stalk]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalk-universal-property]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalk-universal-property]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalk-universal-property]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalk-universal-property|Theorem II.5 Universal Property of a Stalk]]"}],"outgoing":["46dda10bcd4e0ee1"]}